# Cloudflare Pages — _redirects
# SEO-friendly URL redirects

# CEO P0 Trust Containment (2026-09): InterContinental Fiji Golf Resort & Spa is
# a single real property at Natadola Bay — there is no "InterContinental
# Denarau". The old page invented a nonexistent Denarau location, distance and
# fare for the same hotel. The source file has been deleted — these rules are
# what make the old URL resolve at all now. 301 (not 200) so search engines
# transfer ranking signal to the corrected, authoritative page rather than
# treating this as a soft rewrite. All three historical forms listed
# explicitly, INCLUDING the .html variant: Cloudflare Pages' automatic
# .html-stripping redirect only fires for files that still exist on disk, so
# without an explicit rule here the deleted page's .html URL falls through to
# the default index.html SPA-fallback (200, wrong content) instead of
# redirecting — confirmed by direct testing, not assumed.
/transfer/intercontinental-fiji-golf-resort         /transfer/intercontinental-fiji-natadola   301
/transfer/intercontinental-fiji-golf-resort/        /transfer/intercontinental-fiji-natadola   301
/transfer/intercontinental-fiji-golf-resort.html    /transfer/intercontinental-fiji-natadola   301

/transfers          /index.html         200
/tours              /index.html         200
/book               /index.html         200
/faq                /index.html         200
/nadi-to-denarau    /index.html         200
/nadi-to-coral-coast /index.html        200
/nadi-to-pacific-harbour /index.html    200
/airport-transfer   /index.html         200
